            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A display apparatus including a cabinet, a display panel disposed on a rear side of the cabinet to display an image toward a front side of the cabinet, a backlight unit disposed on a rear side of the display panel to provide light onto the display panel, a bottom cover disposed on a rear side of the backlight unit, the bottom cover being coupled to the cabinet to package the display panel and the backlight unit, a main board disposed on a rear side of the bottom cover, the main board being disposed away from a center of a back surface of the bottom cover, and a back cover covering the main board, the back cover being coupled to the bottom cover to partially cover the bottom cover.</p>
